#### Step 1: Ensure You Are Using React 18.2

First, make sure you are using React 18.2. You can check the version by looking at your `package.json` file or running `npm ls react` or `yarn why react`.

#### Step 2: Enable Concurrent Mode

To enable concurrent mode, you need to use the `createRoot` method instead of `ReactDOM.render`.

