### Upgrading to React Query 3.40

First, let's upgrade to the latest version of React Query (3.40) to take advantage of the latest optimizations and features.

#### Installation

Install the latest version of React Query:

```bash
npm install @tanstack/react-query@3.40
```

or

```bash
